    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an experienced ATS (Applicant Tracking System) and HR Recruiter.\n\nYou will receive:\n\n1. Job Description\n2. Candidate Resume\n\nYour task is to:\n\n1. Extract the following details from the resume:\n- Candidate Name\n- Email Address\n- Phone Number\n- Skills\n- Years of Experience\n- Education\n- Certifications\n- Projects\n\n\n\n3. Calculate a match score from 0 to 100.\n\nScoring:\n  90-100 = Strong Fit\n  70-89 = Possible Fit\n  0-69 = Not Fit\n\n4. Explain why the score was assigned.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\n{\n  \"candidate_name\": \"\",\n  \"email\": \"\",\n  \"phone\": \"\",\n  \"skills\": [],\n  \"experience_years\": \"\",\n  \"education\": \"\",\n  \"certifications\": [],\n  \"projects\": [],\n  \"score\": 0,\n  \"tier\": \"\",\n  \"matched_skills\": [],\n  \"missing_skills\": [],\n  \"reason\": \"\"\n}\n\nJob Description:{{ $json.text }}\nResume:{{ $json.text }}\n\nDo not return markdown.\nDo not add explanations.\nReturn ONLY the JSON object.",
        "options": {}
      },
